Android librime static libraries are the fcitx5-android prebuilt archives
(https://github.com/fcitx5-android/prebuilt), built from rime/librime and its
dependencies (glog, yaml-cpp, leveldb, marisa, opencc, lua).

librime and these dependencies are used under their upstream BSD / MIT / Apache
licenses. The IME schema does not enable Lua translators; Lua is linked only
because this prebuilt librime was compiled with the Lua plugin objects.
